{
  "id": "ch03_s15_yeting",
  "chapter": 3,
  "act": 3,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liuchenghuan"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "一件件归还柳的署名、休假与去处；她仍问主角想她怎样选",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳自己的凭据在你手里，你回掖庭找她。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳将杯口缺处转向自己。你进门时，她正把已经空了的稿架再擦一遍。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l3",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "下一叠还没送来？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l4",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "给你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l5",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l6",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把纸分开放。柳先伸手去叠齐，指尖碰到最上面的休凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l7",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "更正送到了，收讫在这。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "更正。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "补了你经手，也留着我准合记那句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "写了会不会有人再问你？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "会，收下过就得答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她沿着更正本找到自己的名字，往下看了两行，又翻回你的签字处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l14",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的名一直在，报功凭你拿着，不留我卷里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "报功凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "放你那里，找着方便。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "误抄试那夜，我多出半日备稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "半日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "已经用了，给钱也换不回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那日没误，便好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "白日工已领，夜里加抄另结了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "缺试照记，能再报，日子还没定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "日子没定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那回我留班，你去过抄试，这是试牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "试牒。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没替你另报下一回。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l28",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳用杯底压住纸角，缺口又朝向你。她察觉了，伸手转回去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三日休补在本月，代班钱清了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "本月。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "省下过的工费，也记在我账上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你哪几日不忙，就填哪几日。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "三日休没划掉。这是以后自己报班的凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "报班的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不是欠我的班。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你用得着的时候再填。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我拿着，又会替你填。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l38",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l39",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你推过去，纸停在杯沿。她将两张经手凭放到下面，只留一格时辰给你看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l40",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我知道那晚有试，还是走了。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l41",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_2": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（三夜。那时我连重新教人都不想。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l42",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_3": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（那册只写我的名。我真想直接合上。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true,
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_2": true,
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_3": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（三回我都没接。那块温布巾，我却握了很久。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l44",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你递热水，我是高兴的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l45",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "高兴？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l46",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不只怕你难过。我也想有人先替我想好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l47",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还照从前，我——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l48",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我不能每回只接这句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l49",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l50",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她的手还托在稿架旁，掌心向上。那里已经没有纸。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l51",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "留原署、另报差都可，做过的工不能扣。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l52",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你想用哪边的人？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l53",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "承欢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l54",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我问的是你。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l55",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l56",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她把休凭推回半寸。杯底带起纸面，留下湿的一圈。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l57",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后日、再后日都有人接，你可挑。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l58",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后日……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l59",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日不答也可，晚些持凭去报。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l60",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你后日呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l61",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我有我的差。这个你自己定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l62",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "自己定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l63",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还给我以后……你想我怎么选？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l64",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l65",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我刚才还想把后日圈好。圈好了，好让她肯拿。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l66",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把笔搁在桌中央。窗外有人晾布，竹竿擦过墙，响了一声。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l67",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "今日不圈，凭据留这。饭和住处不等你答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l68",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那下一叠稿呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l69",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l70",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "交原署，另付经办工，不先送你这。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l71",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳将朱绳从空稿架上解下来。绳的一端绕在腕侧，她解了两下，才从袖口抽出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l72",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这个也不留了？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l73",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "绳子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l74",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "借你束稿的，稿交完，绳还我。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l75",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l76",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的纸不用它束。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l77",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你摊开手。她把绳放进来，手指收回时仍弯着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l78",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "杯子留这，水还温着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l79",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳挪开杯底，把试牒压了进去。应试时辰那一格没有新添的字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l80",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.l81",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你收好归还的朱绳，凭据留在柳手边。"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch03_s15_yeting.cA",
      "text": "收好绳，把她的纸留在她手边",
      "effects": {
        "flag.chenghuan_returned": true
      },
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch03_s16_shuge"
    }
  ]
}
